   "zh": "感谢特朗普总统和梅拉尼娅女士给予我和我夫人的热情接待和周到安排。总统先生和夫人为这次访问做了很多特殊安排，处处都体现出细致和用心，让我们感到宾至如归。在此，我谨向所有关心、支持中美关系发展的美国各界人士致以诚挚问候！此时此刻，中国人民正在欢度中秋节。在中国传统里，中秋节是团圆的佳节。在此，祝大家中秋快乐、阖家幸福！",
   "en": "Thank you, Mr. President and Mrs. Trump, for extending to my wife and me your gracious hospitality and thoughtful arrangements. You and Mrs. Trump have made many special arrangements for our visit, all prepared with meticulous care and consideration in every detail. You make us feel truly at home. I would also like to extend my sincere greetings to Americans from all sectors of society who care about China-U.S. relations and support the further growth of our bilateral ties. As I speak, my compatriots in China are celebrating the Mid-Autumn Festival—a cherished occasion for family reunion in Chinese tradition. I wish you all a very happy Mid-Autumn Festival, and my best wishes to you and your families.",
